    "overview": [
      "Install ffmpeg and libsndfile, then pip install spleeter. Run spleeter separate with a model such as spleeter:2stems and an output folder.",
      "You get one audio file per stem, for example vocals.wav and accompaniment.wav. A Google Colab notebook lets you try it without installing anything, and a Docker image is also available.",
      "Version 2.1.0 changed some CLI options and dropped the separate GPU package, and Apple M1 machines have known TensorFlow issues. It is MIT licensed."
